use ml
arg X .f32 shape 1 768
arg Projection .f32 shape 1 2304
arg Cache .f32 shape 4 1536
arg Mask .f32 shape 1 1 1 4
arg O .f32 shape 768 768
arg Bias .f32 shape 768
arg Scale .f32 shape 1 = array shape 1 fill 0.125
Q = (Projection # (0 till 768)) reshape 1 1 12 64
K = (Cache # (0 till 768)) reshape 1 4 12 64
V = (Cache # (768 till 1536)) reshape 1 4 12 64
Q = Q transpose axis 0 2 1 3
K = K transpose axis 0 2 3 1
V = V transpose axis 0 2 1 3
Scores = Q matmul K rank 2 2 * Scale
Probabilities = (Scores + Mask) softmax
Context = Probabilities matmul V rank 2 2
Merged = Context transpose axis 0 2 1 3
Merged = Merged reshape 1 768
return X + (Merged matmul O) + Bias
